%E9%AD%9A%E5%B1%B1%E4%BF%AF%E7%9E%B0%E5%B8%82%E5%8D%80.jpg","page":"Taitung City","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%8F%B0%E6%9D%B1%E9%AF%89%E9%AD%9A%E5%B1%B1%E4%BF%AF%E7%9E%B0%E5%B8%82%E5%8D%80.jpg","credit":"Liaon98","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0 tw"}},{"name":"Yuli","place":"Yuli, Taiwan","at":[23.3313,121.3215],"text":"Up the flat East Rift Valley between two mountain ranges on Highway 9.","source":{"label":"CycleBlaze (2025)","url":"https://cycleblaze.com/journals/2025cny/yuli-south-to-taitung-city"}},{"name":"Hualien","place":"Hualien, Taiwan","at":[23.9913,121.6197],"text":"Near the marble gorge of Taroko.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2a/Taroko_Gorge4.jpg/500px-Taroko_Gorge4.jpg","page":"Taroko National Park","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Taroko_Gorge4.jpg","credit":"lumoplank","license":"CC0"}},{"name":"Su'ao","place":"Su-ao, Taiwan","at":[24.5946,121.8427],"text":"The Su-Hua cliff road (many take the train past it).","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Taiwan_2009_CingShui_Cliffs_on_SuHua_Highway_FRD_6762_Pano_Extracted.jpg/500px-Taiwan_2009_CingShui_Cliffs_on_SuHua_Highway_FRD_6762_Pano_Extracted.jpg","page":"Suhua Highway","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Taiwan_2009_CingShui_Cliffs_on_SuHua_Highway_FRD_6762_Pano_Extracted.jpg","credit":"Fred Hsu","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"}},{"name":"Back in Taipei","place":"Taipei, Taiwan","at":[25.0375,121.5637],"text":"Back via Yilan and the hills."}],"legs":[{"by":"ride","km":84,"line":[[25.0375,121.5637],[25.0334,121.5325],[25.0415,121.4996],[25.0357,121.4904],[25.0333,121.4711],[25.0365,121.4707],[25.0291,121.4557],[25.0123,121.4419],[24.9761,121.4356],[24.9803,121.4299],[24.9711,121.4156],[24.9674,121.3862],[24.9509,121.3569],[24.9304,121.3403],[24.9324,121.3286],[24.9248,121.3168],[24.9185,121.3149],[24.891,121.2834],[24.872,121.2721],[24.855,121.2708],[24.8255,121.2521],[24.8275,121.24